      "code_hash": "16b1ca15c74a493a723eb696ea0d18e5",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"n1-features\">N1 features</h1>\n<ol>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(v_0||)</marimo-tex> - initial speed, in dataset: <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(v_r||)</marimo-tex></li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(m||)</marimo-tex> - mass, v datasete Mass</li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(A||)</marimo-tex> - area, vypocitame z <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(rel_{wid}||)</marimo-tex> v datasete</li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\rho||)</marimo-tex> - density, ziskame z SOHO\\CELIAS</li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\omega||)</marimo-tex> - solar wind speed, ziskame z SOHO\\CELIAS</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">vystup <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(N_1||)</marimo-tex> je <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(C||)</marimo-tex>, bezdimenzionalny koeficient odporu.</span>\n<h1 id=\"n2-features\">N2 features</h1>\n<ol>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(v_0||)</marimo-tex> - initial speed, in dataset: <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(v_r||)</marimo-tex></li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(m||)</marimo-tex> - mass</li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(A||)</marimo-tex> - area</li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\rho||)</marimo-tex> - density</li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\omega||)</marimo-tex> - solar wind speed</li>\n<li><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(C||)</marimo-tex> z <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(N_1||)</marimo-tex></li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">vystup <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(N_2||)</marimo-tex> je <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(TT||)</marimo-tex>, travel time.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "2bf5e9a14f6734f16da7e18c0bf4cb8f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"wind-speed-extraction\">Wind speed extraction</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Rychlost vetra sa berie ako priemer jednej hodiny po zacati eventu, netrapi nas kde je CME, iba rychlost vetra v L1 v tom case kedy ale CME ide, presnejsie ked je <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(20R\\odot||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "61c44cccbafab63144f60071f72b26ae",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"vypocet-area-z-rel_wid\">Vypocet Area z rel_wid</h2>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\nA = \\pi\\left(r_0 \\sin\\left(\\frac{rel_{wid}}{2}\\right)\\right)^2\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">kde <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(r_0 = 20 R \\odot = 1.3914\\times10^7 \\text{km}||)</marimo-tex></span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "799370995bdc9602aba52129d5261f29",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"loss-function-lt-n1x-for-n1\">Loss function <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(L(t, N1(x))||)</marimo-tex> for N1</h1>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\nL_c(t, N1(x)) = \\left(\\frac{m\\sigma}{A\\rho N1(x)}\\log\\left(1 + \\sigma\\frac{A\\rho N1(x)}{m}(v_0 - w)t + wt\\right) + r_0 - 1\\right)^2\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">kde</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\n\\sigma = \\frac{v_0 - w}{\\sqrt{(v_0 - w)^2 + \\delta}}\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">kde <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\delta||)</marimo-tex> je mala kladna hodnota</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
